**Nuclei per field decreased by 79–84% with PLK1 KO.**

We quantified nuclei per field in [Cell line] cells ([treatment and duration]) labelled with [antibody or dye for each stain]. Small dots show individual fields; large symbols show the value of each run (the mean of its fields); lines join the same run; horizontal lines show the mean of runs. n = 3 runs per condition; 9 fields per condition; individual fields are not treated as independent replicates. Per-run changes of PLK1 KO relative to Non-targeting: −82% (Run1), −79% (Run2) and −84% (Run3). No hypothesis test or confidence interval was calculated because the independence of the runs was not confirmed.
